OL,3,GNEWSAPolice given more time to question
OL,4,Amurder suspects                        
OL,6,FDetectives have been granted more time 
OL,7,Fto question three people who were      
OL,8,Farrested on suspicion of murder        
OL,9,Ffollowing the death of a man in        
OL,10,FBournemouth.                           
OL,12,FDorset Police said it was called to a  
OL,13,Freport that a man had been found       
OL,14,Finjured at an address in Frances Road  
OL,15,Fat about 18:00 GMT on Thursday.        
OL,17,FThe 71-year-old, from Bournemouth, was 
OL,18,Flater confirmed dead at the scene.     
OL,19,FThree people - a 51-year-old man, a    
OL,20,F43-year-old man and a 34-year-old      
OL,21,Fwoman, all from Bournemouth - were     
OL,22,Farrested on suspicion of murder.       
